<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Lee Cty Hsg, Fla., $16 mln.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Lee Cty Hsg, Fla., $16 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James &amp; Associates, Inc. said it received the written award for the $16 million of Lee County Housing Finance Authority, Fla., single family mortgage revenue bonds, Series 1997 A, Sub-Series 1, with a top yield of 6.20 percent in 2027.</p>
<p>The final pricing follows:</p>
